cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the EACW, please cite the edition you used."
type: dataset
title: "The Extended African Comparative Wordlist (EACW)"
abstract: >-
  A comparative wordlist and system of lexical reference for field linguists:
  2,553 items in nineteen semantic sections (2,268 in the default list), each with a
  meaningful reference, a default word class, clarifications, taxa for animals and plants,
  regional codes, and correspondences with the SIL Comparative African Wordlist and the
  Swadesh list. Maintained in dated editions.
authors:
